        "kind": "prose",
        "prose": [
          { "text": "The neon lights of Elysia flickered through the cold rain." },
          { "text": "Rin walked between narrow alleys where steam rose from the drains and mixed with the metallic scent of the city." },
          { "text": "In her hand, a small device sent out a faint signal, but it was enough to guide her forward." },
          { "kind": "emphasis", "text": "If this map is right, the place is at the end of this alley." },
          { "text": "She tightened her coat and moved on. Then a sound rose from the darkness behind her." },
          { "kind": "separator", "text": "* * *" },
          { "text": "When Rin woke, she was lying in a dark room surrounded by old screens." },
          { "text": "A voice came from the shadows and a silver-haired man stepped into the dim light." },
          { "kind": "emphasis", "text": "At last, you are awake." },
          { "text": "Rin blinked, trying to remember what had happened and why she had been brought here." },
          { "text": "The man watched her quietly. The answers she wanted were closer than she knew." }
        ]
      }
    ],
